                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "AhG1q",
                  "name": "B",
                  "fill": "$ink-tertiary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "The as-is Model section is not a flat list: it groups into file fields, then a Geometry sub-heading, then a Bounds sub-heading, none of them independently collapsible. This proposal drew one flat key-value run. The engine variant adopts the same three-part internal structure, dropping only the file rows that a cooked scene has no answer for.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
