                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "E3nliL",
                      "name": "Text",
                      "fill": "$ink-tertiary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Inter on the egui Proportional family, IBM Plex Mono on Monospace, matching the web's font-ui and font-mono roles. Lilex is retired. Rejected: keeping Lilex for both families, which left the two shells reading differently for no reason; and Inter alone, which would have collapsed Monospace onto a proportional face and broken column alignment in the Console and every numeric grid.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                      "fontSize": 11,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
