                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The web canvas fills nodes with category pastels because they are spatial cards that must be told apart at a glance. A dense text tree does not need that and would read as noise, so it stays neutral grey with amber for selection.",
