                      "name": "Text",
                      "fill": "$ink-tertiary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Engine scenes have objects where a file has only meshes. Materials stay flat and deduped, because they are shared across objects and nesting them per object would duplicate them and misrepresent ownership.",
