                      "name": "Text",
                      "fill": "$ink-tertiary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Model becomes Scene, since a cooked scene has no filename, format or byte size. HDRI becomes Environment, since after 0.8.2 it is a node with rotation and intensity rather than a bare file.",
