              "fill": "$ink-tertiary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Traced from a running instance. Properties carries three collapsing sections, and the Model section groups internally into file, geometry and bounds without those sub-groups being collapsible themselves. Values are monospace so digits align down the column; keys are UI type. A validation row click flies the active camera to the affected mesh. The Console buffer captures trace level by default and the dropdown filters what is shown, so lowering it reveals rather than re-records.",
