                      "fill": "$ink-tertiary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Toasts and the legend paint white on their own black-alpha chip. They must stay readable over an arbitrary 3D scene, so theme ink would fail on a bright viewport.",
