                      "name": "B",
                      "fill": "$ink-tertiary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Not a WGSL pipeline. That gives free text, one-call pane clipping, and no z-fight against bloom or SSAO, at the cost of markers not participating in post-processing. A deliberate readability trade.",
